window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Dangerous technology, shifters, and romancing an introvert.</b></p> <p>The Matchmaker's Book Club is back in action, stirring up romance with Gerri's legendary matchmaking skills. With a stack of love stories and a keen sense for true love, these crafty mamas are plotting to unite two headstrong gamers. Cat and Keir are about to start their own love story, thanks to a little push from some meddlesome but well-meaning matriarchs!</p> <p>When Cat Reeves, a brilliant software engineer, joins a prestigious gaming company, she doesn't expect to find herself in the middle of a high-stakes romance that feels ripped straight from the pages of her favorite fantasy novels. The big, hunky and dashing company owner keeps flirting with her, making focusing on her job impossible.</p> <p>Keir Sharpe, dragon shifter and CEO of Sharpe Drakon Games, is tired of dodging his family's matchmaking schemes. Fate and a very clever matchmaker push him towards the one woman who can ignite his fire. The instant attraction he feels for the shy and sweet genius makes Keir want to spend every second of the day with her, blurring the line between personal and professional.</p> <p>Cat is thrilled to work on groundbreaking AI projects, not realizing her new boss is about to rewrite the code of her heart. And when a sinister rival threatens her safety, Keir's dragon instincts kick into high gear. As danger looms and passion ignites, Cat and Keir must navigate a world of tech secrets, dangerous games, and meddling family members. Will Cat decode the secrets of Keir's heart? And can Keir convince her that love is the greatest adventure of all?</p> <p><i>Get ready to dive into a sizzling tale filled with fiery kisses, shadowy threats, and a love that blazes brighter than dragonfire. This paranormal rom-com will sweep you off your feet and leave you breathless for more, proving that in the game of love, the heart always wins!</i></p>"; 
